1
00:01:31,007 --> 00:01:52,267
It's starting to get colder.

2
00:01:52,607 --> 00:01:55,327
I like it better than the heat. It feels so crisp outside.

3
00:01:55,767 --> 00:01:58,627
Yeah, yeah, that's great. Now, could you tell me where we're going, Shinoa?

4
00:01:58,627 --> 00:02:01,827
Huh? Relying on you to navigate for us is getting kind of annoying.

5
00:02:02,367 --> 00:02:06,027
Well, if we stay on this road, we'll eventually end up in Hakone.

6
00:02:06,507 --> 00:02:10,547
There, we could soak in the hot spring, eat a feast, and then wake up relaxed and refreshed.

7
00:02:10,667 --> 00:02:12,627
Doesn't that sound like paradise, you guys?

8
00:02:14,107 --> 00:02:14,507
Sure.

9
00:02:15,467 --> 00:02:16,887
We're really headed to Ebina.

10
00:02:17,907 --> 00:02:19,887
Ebina, huh? I don't think I've heard of it.

11
00:02:20,467 --> 00:02:22,167
Honestly, I'd rather go to Hakone.

12
00:02:22,927 --> 00:02:26,867
Oh, definitely. But I'm afraid a vacation just isn't in the cards.

13
00:02:26,867 --> 00:02:29,167
Nagoya is our final destination.

14
00:02:30,527 --> 00:02:33,647
Nagoya? Are you there, Mika?

15
00:02:40,007 --> 00:02:41,527
Crap, they came out of nowhere!

16
00:02:44,867 --> 00:02:45,687
Kill them!

17
00:02:47,067 --> 00:02:48,607
Go! Picture you!

18
00:02:48,607 --> 00:02:59,967
Not slowing down.

19
00:03:00,207 --> 00:03:02,367
No problem. Come on, Hashiromaru!

20
00:03:10,947 --> 00:03:13,407
Kimizuki, another one. Hard right, quick!

21
00:03:13,407 --> 00:03:18,367
What?

22
00:03:18,527 --> 00:03:19,867
Come on, can't we go faster?

23
00:03:20,287 --> 00:03:22,047
Bye-bye, we'll see you in Ebina!

24
00:03:25,227 --> 00:03:27,427
Hey! Wait, where the hell are you going?

25
00:03:31,507 --> 00:03:31,987
Seriously?

26
00:03:31,987 --> 00:03:33,087
What do you think?

27
00:03:51,087 --> 00:03:52,527
Why are you creeping around, Ghoshi?

28
00:03:53,247 --> 00:03:55,147
Hey, look, Curran. You like?

29
00:03:55,147 --> 00:03:56,387
Do I like what?

30
